[36m(TaskRunner pid=391279)[0m We factorize the problem by considering the prime factors of \(9!\). The divisors of \(9!\) that have a units digit of 1 must satisfy:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=391279)[0m \[ d = 2^a \times 3^b \times 7^c \]
